From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wolf Vollprecht <w.vollprecht@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 18:05:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] gxf_isaac_gems: drop the Eigen 3.3 version floor

Same over-constraint as ISSUES.md #13, in a different file. `gxf_isaac_gems` asks for

    find_package(Eigen3 3.3 REQUIRED NO_MODULE)

and Eigen's own `Eigen3ConfigVersion.cmake` implements `SameMajorVersion`, so a request
for "3.3" is *rejected* by Eigen 5 rather than satisfied by it:

    CMake Error at CMakeLists.txt:28 (find_package):
      Could not find a configuration file for package "Eigen3" that is compatible
      with requested version "3.3".
        .../share/eigen3/cmake/Eigen3Config.cmake, version: 5.0.1
          The version found is not compatible with the version requested.

The intent is clearly a floor -- "at least 3.3" -- which is what the number reads as in
most `find_package` calls and what it does mean under module mode. Under config mode it
becomes an upper bound as well, and `NO_MODULE` forces config mode, so the usual escape
hatch (ros-jazzy-eigen3-cmake-module's module-mode FindEigen3.cmake, which treats the
version as a floor) cannot apply here.

Nothing about the package needs Eigen 3 specifically. `gxf_isaac_gems` is
`add_library(${PROJECT_NAME} INTERFACE)` -- it compiles no translation unit of its own
and links nothing; it exports include directories and installs headers that consumers
compile themselves. So the Eigen version present when *this* package configures does not
even reach a binary, while the floor stops it configuring at all against the Eigen 5 that
ROS 2 Jazzy has moved to. The headers themselves (`gems/core/math/so3.hpp`,
`gems/core/math/types.hpp`, `gems/composite/*`) use `Eigen::Matrix`, `Eigen::Quaternion`
and `Eigen::Map`, all unchanged across the versions in question.

Dropping the version from the request keeps the dependency REQUIRED and lets it be
satisfied by any Eigen 3 that already worked as well as by Eigen 5.
---
 isaac_ros_gxf_extensions/gxf_isaac_gems/CMakeLists.txt | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/isaac_ros_gxf_extensions/gxf_isaac_gems/CMakeLists.txt b/isaac_ros_gxf_extensions/gxf_isaac_gems/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/isaac_ros_gxf_extensions/gxf_isaac_gems/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/isaac_ros_gxf_extensions/gxf_isaac_gems/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -25,7 +25,7 @@ endif()
 find_package(ament_cmake_auto REQUIRED)
 ament_auto_find_build_dependencies()

-find_package(Eigen3 3.3 REQUIRED NO_MODULE)
+find_package(Eigen3 REQUIRED NO_MODULE)

 # Determine the architecture
 if(CMAKE_SYSTEM_PROCESSOR MATCHES "aarch64")
